# 1. Lab Setup

**Filename**

```
01-lab-setup.png
```

**Caption**

> Virtual lab environment consisting of Kali Linux and Windows 10 virtual machines running on VMware Workstation. Wireshark was used to capture and analyze network traffic generated between the systems.

