# 4. HTTP Analysis

**Filename**

```
04-http-get-request.png
```

**Caption**

> HTTP traffic captured while accessing a web page. The capture shows an HTTP GET request from the client and an HTTP/1.1 response from the server, illustrating the request-response communication model.

