# 5. HTTPS / TLS Analysis

**Filename**

```
05-tls-https-analysis.png
```

**Caption**

> TLS-encrypted HTTPS communication captured while accessing Google. Wireshark displays the TLS handshake and encrypted application data exchanged between the client and remote servers.

