# 6. TCP Analysis

**Filename**

```
06-tcp-three-way-handshake.png
```

**Caption**

> TCP packets showing the complete three-way handshake (SYN → SYN-ACK → ACK), followed by HTTP communication and graceful connection termination using FIN and ACK packets.

